---
title: Scotch Sour
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, scotch]
source: Classic cocktail, number 37 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @blended Scotch{2%fl_oz}, @lemon juice{0.75%fl_oz} and @simple syrup{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #rocks glass{}(with ice). Add @Angostura bitters{1%dash} on top.

> Add an egg white and dry-shake first for a silkier sour.
